disorders and was able to control her actions, they agreed that she had been deceived, abused, abused and manipulated. Clara was the only defendant who admitted to her actions. The others fully denied the allegations against them. Barbora Shklova testified briefly in person and the rest of her statement was read out by the judge. She stated that she was not a perpetrator of deception or abuse, but a victim of it. She claimed that she had been repeatedly locked up, beaten, tied to tables, sexually abused and cut with knives by the Maurova sisters and Hanna Bashova. Other strangers took part as well. Barbora also claimed that

